{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-index-js","path":"/","result":{"data":{"hero":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Hello, my name is","name":"Sandeep Lodhi","subtitle":"I build backends that stay fast under load.","buttonText":"Get In Touch"},"html":"<p>I’m a Backend Engineer from New Delhi, India, with 4 years of experience building production Node.js and TypeScript services for healthcare, business intelligence, logistics and media platforms.</p>\n<p>I focus on REST API design, data modeling, caching, background jobs and cloud deployment, and I now bring LLM integration into the systems I build.</p>"}}]},"about":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"About Me","avatar":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#e8e8e8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/287dfb9459a1918a47a9bb8cdd794cdb/47919/me.jpg","srcSet":"/static/287dfb9459a1918a47a9bb8cdd794cdb/3dcba/me.jpg 115w,\n/static/287dfb9459a1918a47a9bb8cdd794cdb/5eb43/me.jpg 230w,\n/static/287dfb9459a1918a47a9bb8cdd794cdb/47919/me.jpg 460w","sizes":"(min-width: 460px) 460px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/287dfb9459a1918a47a9bb8cdd794cdb/53465/me.avif 115w,\n/static/287dfb9459a1918a47a9bb8cdd794cdb/a2a6a/me.avif 230w,\n/static/287dfb9459a1918a47a9bb8cdd794cdb/f234c/me.avif 460w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 460px) 460px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/287dfb9459a1918a47a9bb8cdd794cdb/07447/me.webp 115w,\n/static/287dfb9459a1918a47a9bb8cdd794cdb/640c3/me.webp 230w,\n/static/287dfb9459a1918a47a9bb8cdd794cdb/292f6/me.webp 460w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 460px) 460px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":700}}},"skills":null},"html":"<p>Hello! I'm Sandeep Lodhi, a Backend Engineer based in New Delhi, India.</p>\n<p>Over the past 4 years I have built production Node.js services for healthcare, business intelligence, logistics and media platforms, for clients in the USA, Israel, Spain and Australia.</p>\n<p>My strengths are REST API design, SQL and NoSQL data modeling, caching, background jobs and cloud deployment. I led backend delivery for a high-traffic global media platform, and I have cut API and processing time by 30% across three different systems.</p>\n<p>More recently I have been working in AI engineering: integrating LLMs through the OpenAI API, function calling, structured outputs and retrieval-augmented generation.</p>\n<p>I hold a B.Tech in Computer Science Engineering from Technocrats Institute of Technology, Bhopal (2019 – 2023, CGPA 8.7/10).</p>"}}]},"jobs":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Backend Developer","company":"Atiya","location":"Karol Bagh, New Delhi","range":"Aug 2025 - Present","url":"https://atiyaherbs.com/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Built the backend for a WhatsApp Automation Platform and a Hospital Appointment CRM.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Developed REST APIs for scheduling, patient records, campaigns and call history.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Integrated Exotel WhatsApp APIs for automated messaging.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Built the WebRTC session backend for doctor–patient video calls.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Implemented JWT auth, role-based access control and request validation.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Optimized MongoDB queries and APIs, cutting processing time by 30%.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Deployed to production on IIS/IISNode behind Cloudflare.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Backend Developer","company":"Morpheme","location":"Gaur City, Greater Noida","range":"Nov 2024 - Jul 2025","url":"https://www.webnexus.in/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Designed Node.js/Express.js services and REST APIs for production business apps; owned API contracts with frontend teams.</li>\n<li>Built dynamic RBAC and authentication for multi-user apps; designed schemas and tuned queries for high-volume workflows.</li>\n<li>Cut deployment time by 40% by moving workloads to AWS Lambda with automated CI/CD pipelines.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Backend Developer","company":"MSAI","location":"Pashchim Vihar, New Delhi","range":"Aug 2023 - Oct 2024","url":"https://www.msai.in/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Developed Node.js backend services and REST APIs for multiple production web apps, including auth, validation and third-party integrations.</li>\n<li>Optimized APIs and database queries, contributing to a 20% increase in user engagement and faster page loads.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Software Developer","company":"Shaligram","location":"Ahmedabad, Gujarat","range":"Feb 2023 - Aug 2023","url":"https://www.shaligraminfotech.com/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Improved enterprise application response time by 30% through REST API optimization.</li>\n<li>Tuned MS SQL queries for a 20% performance gain.</li>\n</ul>"}}]},"featured":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"TorahAnytime","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#f8f8f8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/f4b9e4ac20ef22e01322fb0ca7976794/cbfa8/torahanytime.png","srcSet":"/static/f4b9e4ac20ef22e01322fb0ca7976794/99118/torahanytime.png 175w,\n/static/f4b9e4ac20ef22e01322fb0ca7976794/18b9b/torahanytime.png 350w,\n/static/f4b9e4ac20ef22e01322fb0ca7976794/cbfa8/torahanytime.png 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/f4b9e4ac20ef22e01322fb0ca7976794/34607/torahanytime.avif 175w,\n/static/f4b9e4ac20ef22e01322fb0ca7976794/d8e76/torahanytime.avif 350w,\n/static/f4b9e4ac20ef22e01322fb0ca7976794/e6fe1/torahanytime.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/f4b9e4ac20ef22e01322fb0ca7976794/6ba49/torahanytime.webp 175w,\n/static/f4b9e4ac20ef22e01322fb0ca7976794/c8347/torahanytime.webp 350w,\n/static/f4b9e4ac20ef22e01322fb0ca7976794/6eb8d/torahanytime.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":312}}},"tech":["Node.js","Express.js","MySQL","Redis","Sequelize","AWS (S3, EC2, RDS)","Docker","Kubernetes","RabbitMQ","ElasticSearch","DigitalOcean","TRPC","Swagger (OpenAPI)"],"github":"","external":"https://torahanytime.com/"},"html":"<p>Developed and maintained a large-scale religious media and donations platform.<br>\nLed project workflow: assigned tickets, reviewed pull requests, merged code, and deployed to production.<br>\nContributed as a lead developer — resolved backend issues, guided junior developers, and delivered key feature updates.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"ViewReports","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#f8f8f8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/7d2ca2531eed57d8aa4b19510da592f8/1cfd0/viewreports.png","srcSet":"/static/7d2ca2531eed57d8aa4b19510da592f8/677c8/viewreports.png 175w,\n/static/7d2ca2531eed57d8aa4b19510da592f8/fbe7c/viewreports.png 350w,\n/static/7d2ca2531eed57d8aa4b19510da592f8/1cfd0/viewreports.png 700w,\n/static/7d2ca2531eed57d8aa4b19510da592f8/2facf/viewreports.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/7d2ca2531eed57d8aa4b19510da592f8/863c5/viewreports.avif 175w,\n/static/7d2ca2531eed57d8aa4b19510da592f8/d9aff/viewreports.avif 350w,\n/static/7d2ca2531eed57d8aa4b19510da592f8/459d9/viewreports.avif 700w,\n/static/7d2ca2531eed57d8aa4b19510da592f8/29467/viewreports.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/7d2ca2531eed57d8aa4b19510da592f8/34646/viewreports.webp 175w,\n/static/7d2ca2531eed57d8aa4b19510da592f8/7a43c/viewreports.webp 350w,\n/static/7d2ca2531eed57d8aa4b19510da592f8/d1542/viewreports.webp 700w,\n/static/7d2ca2531eed57d8aa4b19510da592f8/b1f71/viewreports.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"tech":["Node.js","Express 5","PostgreSQL","SQL Server","SQLite","Redis","BullMQ","React 19","TanStack Query","IIS"],"github":"","external":""},"html":"<p>Call-center business intelligence platform with 45+ self-service reports over telephony and order data, on tables of 50M+ rows.\nA chunked, incremental ETL syncs PostgreSQL and SQL Server into a local SQLite read model, taking heavy reports from minutes to milliseconds.\nIncludes JWT with email-OTP login, per-report access control and guarded Excel/CSV export.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Hospital Appointment CRM","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#f8f8f8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/5e7ecfaaf712e14c7d50d7da9673a2df/b72a7/hospital-crm.png","srcSet":"/static/5e7ecfaaf712e14c7d50d7da9673a2df/1654f/hospital-crm.png 175w,\n/static/5e7ecfaaf712e14c7d50d7da9673a2df/b4da2/hospital-crm.png 350w,\n/static/5e7ecfaaf712e14c7d50d7da9673a2df/b72a7/hospital-crm.png 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/5e7ecfaaf712e14c7d50d7da9673a2df/d060e/hospital-crm.avif 175w,\n/static/5e7ecfaaf712e14c7d50d7da9673a2df/cd34a/hospital-crm.avif 350w,\n/static/5e7ecfaaf712e14c7d50d7da9673a2df/5811d/hospital-crm.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/5e7ecfaaf712e14c7d50d7da9673a2df/5ca39/hospital-crm.webp 175w,\n/static/5e7ecfaaf712e14c7d50d7da9673a2df/d92c5/hospital-crm.webp 350w,\n/static/5e7ecfaaf712e14c7d50d7da9673a2df/174d7/hospital-crm.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":364}}},"tech":["Node.js","Express 5","SQL Server","Redis","React 19","Redux Toolkit","Tailwind CSS","Swagger / OpenAPI","IIS","IISNode"],"github":"","external":""},"html":"<p>Agent-facing CRM for clinic appointments that replaced a legacy ASP.NET WebForms system and runs inside the Ameyo dialer with single sign-on.\nBuilt 47 API modules with OpenAPI docs, 463 models generated from SQL DDL, 23 disposition panels and 16 dynamic consultation forms.\nIntegrated the dialer, Exotel WhatsApp and SMS gateways with retry and delivery tracking, deployed on Windows Server with IIS and IISNode.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"BikeShopShippers","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#383838","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/973925485e410ed5999666f32a569f6e/ff218/bikeshopshippers.png","srcSet":"/static/973925485e410ed5999666f32a569f6e/78378/bikeshopshippers.png 175w,\n/static/973925485e410ed5999666f32a569f6e/30f7d/bikeshopshippers.png 350w,\n/static/973925485e410ed5999666f32a569f6e/ff218/bikeshopshippers.png 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/973925485e410ed5999666f32a569f6e/8a77f/bikeshopshippers.avif 175w,\n/static/973925485e410ed5999666f32a569f6e/96eb4/bikeshopshippers.avif 350w,\n/static/973925485e410ed5999666f32a569f6e/d120d/bikeshopshippers.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/973925485e410ed5999666f32a569f6e/56c19/bikeshopshippers.webp 175w,\n/static/973925485e410ed5999666f32a569f6e/3160c/bikeshopshippers.webp 350w,\n/static/973925485e410ed5999666f32a569f6e/2d668/bikeshopshippers.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":353}}},"tech":["Medusa.js","Node.js","Next.js","PostgreSQL","Redis","TypeORM","Stripe","UPS API","Google Maps API","GitHub","DigitalOcean","CI/CD"],"github":"","external":"https://bikeshopshippers.com/us"},"html":"<p>Developed a logistics management dashboard for bulk shipping operations.<br>\nBuilt backend APIs for order, delivery, and tracking management.<br>\nImplemented CI/CD pipelines and GitHub project boards for seamless release tracking.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Likho","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#f8f8f8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/b7e608584502ca4a218aa8ccadc01aa8/8fdb2/likho.png","srcSet":"/static/b7e608584502ca4a218aa8ccadc01aa8/5a09a/likho.png 175w,\n/static/b7e608584502ca4a218aa8ccadc01aa8/b4c9a/likho.png 350w,\n/static/b7e608584502ca4a218aa8ccadc01aa8/8fdb2/likho.png 700w,\n/static/b7e608584502ca4a218aa8ccadc01aa8/09576/likho.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/b7e608584502ca4a218aa8ccadc01aa8/443b6/likho.avif 175w,\n/static/b7e608584502ca4a218aa8ccadc01aa8/89323/likho.avif 350w,\n/static/b7e608584502ca4a218aa8ccadc01aa8/32902/likho.avif 700w,\n/static/b7e608584502ca4a218aa8ccadc01aa8/22456/likho.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/b7e608584502ca4a218aa8ccadc01aa8/aa1f5/likho.webp 175w,\n/static/b7e608584502ca4a218aa8ccadc01aa8/1e28b/likho.webp 350w,\n/static/b7e608584502ca4a218aa8ccadc01aa8/647f1/likho.webp 700w,\n/static/b7e608584502ca4a218aa8ccadc01aa8/4eb0e/likho.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":438}}},"tech":["NestJS","Go","Python","gRPC","NATS","PostgreSQL","MongoDB","ClickHouse","Meilisearch","Kubernetes","React"],"github":"https://github.com/likho-ai","external":""},"html":"<p>Turns Hindi, Urdu and English call recordings into text a team can read, search and correct, with every line kept in both the spoken script and Hinglish.\nA language model summarises each call, reads the customer's mood and pre-fills the auditor's form, with analytics on top.\nBuilt as microservices with a dialer connector that pulls calls from Ameyo and writes transcripts back to the CRM.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"WhatsApp Automation Platform","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#f8f8f8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/0c42df13762827ef41a402e442a9fad7/06ac8/whatsapp-automation.png","srcSet":"/static/0c42df13762827ef41a402e442a9fad7/1e2a1/whatsapp-automation.png 175w,\n/static/0c42df13762827ef41a402e442a9fad7/35b80/whatsapp-automation.png 350w,\n/static/0c42df13762827ef41a402e442a9fad7/06ac8/whatsapp-automation.png 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/0c42df13762827ef41a402e442a9fad7/a8132/whatsapp-automation.avif 175w,\n/static/0c42df13762827ef41a402e442a9fad7/f5ae1/whatsapp-automation.avif 350w,\n/static/0c42df13762827ef41a402e442a9fad7/1b14f/whatsapp-automation.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/0c42df13762827ef41a402e442a9fad7/f2848/whatsapp-automation.webp 175w,\n/static/0c42df13762827ef41a402e442a9fad7/13d34/whatsapp-automation.webp 350w,\n/static/0c42df13762827ef41a402e442a9fad7/d7d86/whatsapp-automation.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":314}}},"tech":["Node.js","Express.js","Socket.IO","MongoDB Atlas","React 19","Exotel WhatsApp API","Cloudinary","PM2","Cloudways"],"github":"","external":"http://whatsapp.atiyaherbs.com"},"html":"<p>Real-time shared WhatsApp Business inbox for support agents, built on the Exotel WhatsApp API.\nIncoming webhooks are stored in MongoDB and pushed to agents over Socket.IO, with delivery-status tracking and unread badges.\nReplies are routed automatically from the same business number the customer wrote to, with retry and exponential backoff on sends.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"QMS Call Audit","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#f8f8f8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/ac925b5ee8e171b98234897db55a7874/1cfd0/qms.png","srcSet":"/static/ac925b5ee8e171b98234897db55a7874/677c8/qms.png 175w,\n/static/ac925b5ee8e171b98234897db55a7874/fbe7c/qms.png 350w,\n/static/ac925b5ee8e171b98234897db55a7874/1cfd0/qms.png 700w,\n/static/ac925b5ee8e171b98234897db55a7874/2facf/qms.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/ac925b5ee8e171b98234897db55a7874/863c5/qms.avif 175w,\n/static/ac925b5ee8e171b98234897db55a7874/d9aff/qms.avif 350w,\n/static/ac925b5ee8e171b98234897db55a7874/459d9/qms.avif 700w,\n/static/ac9